  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#e03e2d\"><strong>自2025年6月1日起，所有ampz模组未来的更新都将需要Voltaic API而非Electrodynamics才能正常运行。此更新影响所有模组，并带来破坏存档兼容性的更改（详见更新日志）。请注意，这通常不会损坏您的世界。如果遇到此类问题，请前往我们的Discord频道联系我们！</strong></span></p>\n<p>Electrodynamics是一款将基于现实的科学与科技引入Minecraft的模组，并包含其他一些新增内容。该模组旨在保持真实感的同时提供愉快的游玩体验。<br>本模组作为多个旨在重现旧版Voltz整合包的其他模组的核心组件，包括Nuclear Science、MFFS、ICBM等。</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f00\"><strong>本项目基于 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/voltaic-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Voltaic</a>&nbsp;，运行此模组必须安装它。</strong></span></p>\n<p><strong>欢迎加入我们的Discord：<a href=\"https://discord.gg/bzH7CdQWRb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/569969909380153345.svg?label=Join us on Discord&logo=discord&logoColor=FFFFFF&style=flat-square\" alt=\"Discord\" width=\"189\" height=\"20\"></a></strong></p>\n<p><strong>也欢迎支持我的新Patreon：</strong>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/aurilisdev\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=aurilisdev&type=patrons&style=for-the-badge\" width=\"196\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<strong>模组复兴计划：</strong></p>\n<p>如前所述，本模组正致力于复活许多已被弃坑但极其优秀的模组。以下列出了一些正在被恢复和重制的模组：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Nuclear Science 1.21 (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nuclear-science\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">项目页面</a>)</li>\n<li>Ballistix 1.21 (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ballistix\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">项目页面</a>)</li>\n<li>Assembly Line 1.21 (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/assembly-lines\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">项目页面</a>)</li>\n<li>Blastcraft 1.21 (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/blast-craft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">项目页面</a>)</li>\n<li>Modular Forcefield System 1.21 (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modular-forcefields\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">项目页面</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/316867/description_204fa046-74ba-4271-b5ca-df80ac7c5df1.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>此外，也欢迎查看该模组的其它附属模组：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Extended Tools 1.20 (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/extended-tools\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">项目页面</a>)</li>\n<li>Dynamic Electricity (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-electricity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">项目页面</a>) &lt;- 可用于转换来自其他模组的电力。</li>\n<li>Chemical Science (<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chemical-science\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">项目页面</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#36f\">也欢迎在此查看我们的官方整合包：&nbsp;<a style=\"color:#36f\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/ampz-1-17\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/ampz-1-18</a></span><br><span style=\"color:#36f\">这是专为Minecraft 1.20复刻的Voltz整合包</span><br></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#36f\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/V-ZtbTuvHuU?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>功能特性：</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li>真实的资源系统</li>\n<li>拟真的发电机制</li>\n<li>精确的电力传输与损耗模拟</li>\n<li>辐射效果</li>\n<li>矿石加工强化</li>\n<li>太阳能发电系统</li>\n<li>燃煤发电</li>\n<li>多样化的机械</li>\n<li>高级科技集成</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>捐赠</strong></p>\n<p>也非常感谢您的慷慨捐赠。</p>\n<p>[点击此处进行捐赠](<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fcgi-bin%252fwebscr%253freturn%253dhttps%253a%252f%252fwww.curseforge.com%252fprojects%252f316867%2526cn%253dAdd%2bspecial%2binstructions%2bto%2bthe%2baddon%2bauthor()%2526business%253daurilisdev%2540gmail.com%2526bn%253dPP-DonationsBF%253abtn_donateCC_LG.gif%253aNonHosted%2526cancel_return%253dhttps%253a%252f%252fwww.curseforge.com%252fprojects%252f316867%2526lc%253dUS%2526item_name%253dElectrodynamics%2b(from%2bcurseforge.com)%2526cmd%253d_donations%2526rm%253d1%2526no_shipping%253d1%2526currency_code%253dUSD\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">链接...</a>)</p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>在整合包中使用的权限：</strong></p>\n<p>是的，您被允许这样做：</p>\n<p>但是，正如许可证中所写（关于分发的特殊权限）：</p>\n<pre><code>您仅可在为本软件所有者“Sebastian Siljuholtet Johansen”提供适当署名（以Credits形式呈现）以及指向该软件官方下载页面的URL（供访问整合包时使用）的情况下，使用上述特殊权限。</code></pre>",
